<title>CANADA: Arakis says plaintiffs refile lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Arakis says plaintiffs refile lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arakis Energy Corp said the plaintiffs in a class action lawsuit against Arakis, which was dismissed in November, have filed an amendment to their original complaint.</p>
<p>In a statement released on Friday Arakis said it will continue to vigorously defend the action. The suit, entitled &quot;In Re: Arakis Energy Corp Securities Litigation (95 CV34431 (ARR))&quot; was dismissed in November.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
